{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/983034-example-mysteries","id":983034,"title":"Example Mysteries","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-06T17:46:34-07:00","id":983034,"title":"Example Mysteries","content":"I find it helps me to be creative if I have a large body of existing examples to riff off. Mysteries are something I've struggled to put together.<br /> Post any and all Mysteries you've used or come up with - I'll see about trying to compile them in a useful resource.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Death:</b></span><ul><li>Potentially anything to do with a haunting?</li> <li>Canals across the city begin reopening and filling with spectral waters at night. Only a few night workers and homeless folk have been harmed by the unexpected troughs, but the spectral water does not float the material, it does make them think they are drowning. the Canals disappear at dawn, but more of them are appearing and the ones which connect seem to be drawing strange specters. (<b>also Spirit</b>)</li> <li>An aging British musician is convinced that the recent deaths of his friends David Bowie and Alan Rickman mean that he's next, revealing them to be part of a Mystery Cult pact.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Fate:</b></span><ul><li>A number that, when dialed, lists a time and date. A personally relevant death will happen on that date.</li> <li>A group of quintuplets are born at a local hospital, and under Scrutiny, they all share the same Destiny. No, seriously, they're all bound into a single, powerful thread of Destiny.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Forces:</b></span><ul><li>A block of ice refuses to melt, even at high temperatures.</li> <li>A flash drive that cracks any password on any OS in seconds.</li> <li>A girl is lost within the internet after hacking into a strange server.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Life:</b></span><ul><li>A feather found near the village is too large for any bird, what does it belong to?</li> <li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o0u4M6vppCI\" target=\"_blank\">Hollywood Superstar Shia LeBeouf is a superpowered cannibal hunting for sport in the woods.</a></li> <li>What's the meaningful distinction between Life and Matter? When does flesh become Matter, and why? (<b>Also Matter</b>)</li> <li>A girl makes a wish to be special, and all of her friends and family come down with degenerative diseases, while she only becomes stronger and healthier.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Matter:</b></span><ul><li>A Roman in Egypt discovers that the men who were sent to kill Caesarion were turned to stone.</li> <li>A brand of knives turns wood into silver when stabbed into.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Mind:</b></span><ul><li>A strange Goetia is bringing old, nearly-forgotten ideas from the Astral Space into Los Angeles.</li> <li>An NPC on a popular MMO is strangely intelligent.</li> <li>There is a dorm at your local university in which students wake up with not only memories of the past residents who slept there, but sometimes even are rewritten to the personality specs of their source memory. Permanently. Naturally, this doesn't bode well.</li> <li>A character from a popular television show visits the dreams of a PC to talk to them. They allude that the other members of the show have disappeared, which is why it was cancelled.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Prime:</b></span><ul><li>The soul has more than one part, which seems to loosely correspond to the Egyptian conception of a five-part being</li> <li>The mother of one of the PCs died and they're trying to bring them back, but a piece of their soul is missing.</li> <li>A Supernal being survives being torn apart by replacing part of a human soul.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Space:</b></span><ul><li>At the home of a wealthy businessman, a key opens an armoire that leads to an Alpine estate.</li> <li>A trail loops endlessly if you continue down it east-to-west, despite never turning north or south.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Spirit:</b></span><ul><li>There's a door in school that opens to a strange mirror of the world at the right time of day.</li> <li>A reward is being offered for an extinct woodpecker. On investigation, all known sightings have only ever described one individual, expressly named in a local tribe's mythology.</li> <li>A spirit of the city is bribing and manipulating census bureau employees to misreport the population growth of its own city and other cities slightly larger than it, in the hopes of gaining pre-eminence over them in a Spirit court battle over custody of a small neighboring town.</li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Time:</b></span><ul><li>An early 2000s cellphone was discovered in a medieval British burial mound, apparently aged and dated accurately.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":5226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","user":"Jachra","date":". 10-07-2016, 09:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T18:08:16-07:00","id":983052,"title":"","content":"Fate: A group of quintuplets are born at a local hospital, and under Scrutiny, they all share the same Destiny. No, seriously, they're all bound into a single, powerful thread of Destiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T19:40:59-07:00","id":983087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/983034-example-mysteries?p=983052#post983052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate: A group of quintuplets are born at a local hospital, and under Scrutiny, they all share the same Destiny. No, seriously, they're all bound into a single, powerful thread of Destiny.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hopefully they aren't Third-Stage Lensmen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T20:13:10-07:00","id":983109,"title":"","content":"Spirit: A spirit of the city is bribing and manipulating census bureau employees to misreport the population growth of its own city and other cities slightly larger than it, in the hopes of gaining pre-eminence over them in a Spirit court battle over custody of a small neighboring town.<br /> <br /> Death/Spirit: Canals across the city begin reopening and filling with spectral waters at night. Only a few night workers and homeless folk have been harmed by the unexpected troughs, but the spectral water does not float the material, it does make them think they are drowning. the Canals disappear at dawn, but more of them are appearing and the ones which connect seem to be drawing strange specters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1336-gideon","name":"Gideon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1336_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T21:24:24-07:00","id":983134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jachra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/983034-example-mysteries?p=983087#post983087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hopefully they aren't Third-Stage Lensmen.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm afraid I'm not familiar with that. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T22:59:02-07:00","id":983169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/983034-example-mysteries?p=983134#post983134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm afraid I'm not familiar with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lensman is a classic sci-fi opera series by EE Doc Smith.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T12:49:23-07:00","id":983466,"title":"","content":"I think, based on talking to people here (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979960-2e-help-with-focusing-on-mysteries\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...g-on-mysteries</a>) and some of my own readings and musings and further player conversation, a Mystery can also be a weird part of the rules or setting as written. <br /> <br /> Currently have one character who's making a Matter/Life Legacy based around exploring what exactly is the distinction between normal plants and plant matter as used in objects. Like, what's the difference between the wood in a tree and the wood in a rifle stock, or natural rubber and tire rubber. It's structural tissue that's essentially the same, but the two Arcana treat it differently. As he examines it, he'll be able to get in between the two and get special powers over the fuzzy edge case of organic matter. And become the best damn magic gardener you've ever seen, probably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","name":"AinSoph","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T13:36:37-07:00","id":983503,"title":"","content":"Mind Mystery: There is a dorm at your local university in which students wake up with not only memories of the past residents who slept there, but sometimes even are rewritten to the personality specs of their source memory. Permanently. Naturally, this doesn't bode well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}